<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent attacks around Damascus include a car bomb in a suburb that killed a father and his daughter, a separate car bomb near the capital that killed two people including a child, and an improvised explosive device in Jaramana that killed two civilians, one a young girl. A car explosion in the Damascus countryside wounded two people. These incidents show continued violence in the capital region. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNLXNycnVSRjdCSmM2QTlSQ3FFcnd0Nnp4MkcxN2RrX1NHeERWVThvSEZyYi1saUlaZWhxNjJUak1RZ3NhdlB4NjN1VGtVdjY4a3lsaDJyVkU3ejEyNzNaTDdLX1Z5YXd4TFNCSS1JaFc2Qy1rVmF0QUVJTUw5Ym1zblpnTWc1UlA3amlyQ1U1TTNINHVUa1FOODdjYmtpTS1vc3h2ZVVVQi1EZzNTUHMwNW5tWHRHdzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera Centre for Studies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE82TGh6Z2pXR0V2N040VzRWdTd3WnByenJQdTAwLWstblZzakRtaUJaOXl3S3k5X2h1bXFoaF9sQ1psLXhSSVp0cHNBYWdtLTdHdEF3T2lYeWJFNl91dVd4UGZDUEFod2fSAVxBVV95cUxPOTAtaGw0OU1DblNsTUdhOEJOVjlsZVd5TGh3WDMyOHIxeG9WbURaYXlIQjNkRGlCZU5aUGNRTVJQc25DZjNBUmoxOTlNMEpORnBqTm1OMWlqWTVxNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOellsd3Vqak9sMFhiX1BMTk91Wm1jQUw5ckVmQW04T0VVR3V0eXpURUV3Vkg1cDF5aWo1REhxYVhrQlpqWHhTY3dGYjUwbFRYTWlmX0xZSFZyN3Rzdk9sMmJJV3R0X3ZCNG5xTzlfeTZoa3dLYW1sNlc0clR2c3Uwb0gwTFUyX0N0V2VZNURzZTQydksybFl2dC13NFJsSWljd3lIYUJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news